# Instructions
st.markdown("""
<div class="instruction-box">
    <strong>How to use:</strong><br/>
    1. The map shows existing stops (blue) and GNN-predicted candidate stops (green)<br/>
    2. Enter coordinates below or click a candidate stop to see its GNN evaluation<br/>
    3. The model analyzes 42 features including population, infrastructure, and equity metrics<br/>
